context: |
  These uncommitted files are not a new feature. S19 did not own them.
  Decide once, per hunk. Do not add a screen, tab, command, or sensor.
  Files: src/config/lib/navigation.ts and its test,
  src/store/useNavigationStore.ts and its test,
  src/shell/components/MobileShellTabBar.tsx,
  src/screens/settings/SettingsScreen.test.tsx.
  KEEP a hunk only when it matches a rule S19 already froze:
  Home is a bottom tab and the primary hub tab;
  Welcome → Home → Catalog → sensor session;
  installation-report highlights Home;
  settings does not gain a second screen header.
  REVERT chrome S19 did not freeze: icon swaps, padding, glass border,
  type tracking, and screenDepth slide motion.
  A Home tab may keep one icon slot in the existing style.
  Record keep vs revert. Package manager: bun.

out:
  - sprints/S20/LEFTOVER-TREE.md
  - keep or revert on the six files only

cmd:
